 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5a-00",
   "text": "怎么防？有四种做法。",
   "spoken": "怎么防？有四种做法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.928,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.695
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-01",
   "text": "第一，虚拟份额加偏移。OpenZeppelin 从 4.9 版起提供。",
   "spoken": "第一，虚拟份额加偏移。OpenZeppelin 从 4.9 版起提供。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.748,
   "dur": 5.88,
   "speechStart": 4.846,
   "speechEnd": 9.784
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-02",
   "text": "计算份额时，总份额加上 10 的偏移次方，总资产加上 1。",
   "spoken": "计算份额时，总份额加上 10 的偏移次方，总资产加上 1。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.848,
   "dur": 5.688,
   "speechStart": 10.946,
   "speechEnd": 15.684
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-03",
   "text": "攻击者想造成同样的损失，需要捐赠 10 的偏移次方倍的资金。",
   "spoken": "攻击者想造成同样的损失，需要捐赠 10 的偏移次方倍的资金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-03.mp3",
   "start": 16.756,
   "dur": 5.184,
   "speechStart": 16.854,
   "speechEnd": 21.092
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-04",
   "text": "第二，初始存款销毁。部署时先存入一笔，把份额发给死地址。",
   "spoken": "第二，初始存款销毁。部署时先存入一笔，把份额发给死地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-04.mp3",
   "start": 22.16,
   "dur": 6.36,
   "speechStart": 22.258,
   "speechEnd": 27.696
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-05",
   "text": "这样金库永远不会是空的。",
   "spoken": "这样金库永远不会是空的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-05.mp3",
   "start": 28.74,
   "dur": 2.592,
   "speechStart": 28.838,
   "speechEnd": 30.492
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-06",
   "text": "Uniswap V2 也是这个思路：首次添加流动性时，永久锁定 1000 份 LP 代币。",
   "spoken": "Uniswap V2 也是这个思路：首次添加流动性时，永久锁定 1000 份 LP 代币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-06.mp3",
   "start": 31.552,
   "dur": 7.2,
   "speechStart": 31.65,
   "speechEnd": 37.911
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-07",
   "text": "第三，内部记账。用状态变量记录总资产，不读余额。",
   "spoken": "第三，内部记账。用状态变量记录总资产，不读余额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-07.mp3",
   "start": 38.972,
   "dur": 6.336,
   "speechStart": 39.07,
   "speechEnd": 44.46
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-08",
   "text": "捐赠多少，都无法改变份额价格。",
   "spoken": "捐赠多少，都无法改变份额价格。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-08.mp3",
   "start": 45.528,
   "dur": 3.672,
   "speechStart": 45.626,
   "speechEnd": 48.364
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-09",
   "text": "第四，最小份额检查。份额是 0 就回滚，用户也可以设最少到账份额。",
   "spoken": "第四，最小份额检查。份额是 0 就回滚，用户也可以设最少到账份额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-09.mp3",
   "start": 49.42,
   "dur": 6.84,
   "speechStart": 49.518,
   "speechEnd": 55.42
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-10",
   "text": "这样受害者的交易会回滚，而不是换回 0 份额。",
   "spoken": "这样受害者的交易会回滚，而不是换回 0 份额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-10.mp3",
   "start": 56.48,
   "dur": 4.344,
   "speechStart": 56.578,
   "speechEnd": 59.994
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-11",
   "text": "修好了，怎么证明？要两个结果。",
   "spoken": "修好了，怎么证明？要两个结果。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-11.mp3",
   "start": 61.044,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 61.142,
   "speechEnd": 64.032
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-12",
   "text": "漏洞版上，受害者损失资产。修复版上，攻击无利可图。",
   "spoken": "漏洞版上，受害者损失资产。修复版上，攻击无利可图。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-12.mp3",
   "start": 65.104,
   "dur": 6.216,
   "speechStart": 65.202,
   "speechEnd": 70.473
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-13",
   "text": "最后一个案例，是另一种失误。",
   "spoken": "最后一个案例，是另一种失误。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-13.mp3",
   "start": 71.54,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 71.638,
   "speechEnd": 73.816
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-14",
   "text": "2021 年 4 月，BNB Chain 上的 Uranium Finance，分叉自 Uniswap V2。",
   "spoken": "2021 年 4 月，BNB Chain 上的 Uranium Finance，分岔自 Uniswap V2。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-14.mp3",
   "start": 74.88,
   "dur": 6.432,
   "speechStart": 74.978,
   "speechEnd": 80.478
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-15",
   "text": "按公开分析，开发者把手续费从百分之 0.3，改成了百分之 0.16。",
   "spoken": "按公开分析，开发者把手续费从百分之 0.3，改成了百分之 0.16。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-15.mp3",
   "start": 81.532,
   "dur": 6.432,
   "speechStart": 81.63,
   "speechEnd": 87.13
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-16",
   "text": "余额检查左边的放大系数，从 1000 改成了 1 万。",
   "spoken": "余额检查左边的放大系数，从 1000 改成了 1 万。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-16.mp3",
   "start": 88.184,
   "dur": 4.68,
   "speechStart": 88.282,
   "speechEnd": 92.044
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-17",
   "text": "右边那一处，仍是 1000 的平方，漏改了。",
   "spoken": "右边那一处，仍是 1000 的平方，漏改了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-17.mp3",
   "start": 93.084,
   "dur": 4.584,
   "speechStart": 93.182,
   "speechEnd": 96.848
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-18",
   "text": "左边被放大了 100 倍，右边没有。",
   "spoken": "左边被放大了 100 倍，右边没有。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-18.mp3",
   "start": 97.888,
   "dur": 3.456,
   "speechStart": 97.986,
   "speechEnd": 100.521
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-19",
   "text": "不变量 x 乘 y 不小于 k，退化成了不小于 k 的百分之一。",
   "spoken": "不变量 x 乘 y 不小于 k，退化成了不小于 k 的百分之一。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-19.mp3",
   "start": 101.564,
   "dur": 5.088,
   "speechStart": 101.662,
   "speechEnd": 105.816
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-20",
   "text": "攻击者只投入极少量代币，就换出了池子约百分之 99 的储备。",
   "spoken": "攻击者只投入极少量代币，就换出了池子约百分之 99 的储备。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-20.mp3",
   "start": 106.872,
   "dur": 5.448,
   "speechStart": 106.97,
   "speechEnd": 111.47
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-21",
   "text": "按公开报道，损失约 5000 万美元。",
   "spoken": "按公开报道，损失约 5000 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-21.mp3",
   "start": 112.54,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 112.638,
   "speechEnd": 115.53
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-22",
   "text": "教训是：修改过的分叉代码，等于新代码。",
   "spoken": "教训是：修改过的分岔代码，等于新代码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-22.mp3",
   "start": 116.6,
   "dur": 4.488,
   "speechStart": 116.698,
   "speechEnd": 120.257
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-23",
   "text": "改过的常数，每一个使用位置，都要同步。",
   "spoken": "改过的常数，每一个使用位置，都要同步。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-23.mp3",
